        "cooked": "<p>This episode brought to you by Tango<br>\n<a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-92\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-92</a></p>\n<p>Upcoming schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tuesday, September 1st: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#327</span> - Creative Process: Recently Made Heroes from the Interim</li>\n<li>Tuesday, September 8th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#328</span> - Writers’ Room: A Silver Age story where a hero goes back in time and teams up with their younger self</li>\n<li>Tuesday, September 15th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#329</span> - Writers’ Room: The Sobek event</li>\n<li>Tuesday, September 22nd: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#93</span> (the promised Science-sode)</li>\n<li>Tuesday, September 29th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#330</span> - Writers’ Room: Prime Wardens power-switching story</li>\n</ul>",
