        "raw": "This episode brought to you by Tango\nhttps://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-92\n\nUpcoming schedule:\n\n* Tuesday, September 1st: Episode #327 - Creative Process: Recently Made Heroes from the Interim\n* Tuesday, September 8th: Episode #328 - Writers' Room: A Silver Age story where a hero goes back in time and teams up with their younger self\n* Tuesday, September 15th: Episode #329 - Writers' Room: The Sobek event\n* Tuesday, September 22nd: Editor’s Note #93 (the promised Science-sode)\n* Tuesday, September 29th: Episode #330 - Writers' Room: Prime Wardens power-switching story",
