        "created_at": "2026-08-19T00:15:02.755Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh boy, this is a real neat-o slate of upcoming topics! We’ve got two classic goofy Silver Age type stories, two long-awaited stories about DE cards, SCIENCE!, and of course a peak at both what C&amp;A have been doing while twiddling their thumbs and what will—I’m wagering—be some new heroes to fill out the newly-expanded DE roadmap.</p>",
